  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "President Prabowo Subianto has been engaging with police leadership regarding national security and institutional reforms. These discussions follow high-profile meetings at Hambalang, where the President consulted with ten former National Police chiefs on matters including national resource leakage. Recently, the President publicly commended the current police force for their efforts in addressing narcotics distribution, specifically citing the destruction of over 600 tons of illicit drugs. Additionally, the administration has focused on police-led initiatives to curb illegal mining operations and improve social media stability. These interactions occur alongside broader government efforts to strengthen domestic security and address administrative challenges. The President has reiterated the importance of emulating historical figures in the police force, such as Soekanto and Hoegeng, to maintain public trust and professional standards within the National Police.",
